OL,3,W"###"###"###T//,/,--.,-.,,-,-.,-.-.,,//
OL,4,BWiffen named in Ireland squad for      
OL,5,BWorld Championships                    
OL,6,GOlympic gold medallist Daniel Wiffen   
OL,7,Gis included in a 10-strong Team        
OL,8,GIreland squad for December's World     
OL,9,GAquatics Swimming Championships (25m)  
OL,10,Gin China.                              
OL,12,FWiffen - who claimed 1500m silver at   
OL,13,Fthe Commonwealth Games - is joined by  
OL,14,Ffellow Olympians Ellen Walsh and Mona  
OL,15,FMcSharry, who took bronze in Paris     
OL,16,F2024, plus twin brother Nathan.        
OL,22,                                   G4/4 
